---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Devices"
  description="Published device integration notes for auroraADE."
>
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="page-context">Resources / auroraADE</p>
    <h1>Devices</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Published device integration status for auroraADE.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="device-report">
    <header class="device-report-heading">
      <h2>Last published status</h2>
      <p>These entries are preserved from the previous project status page. They are not live build or device checks.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="device-report-grid">
      <article class="device-report-card">
        <span class="device-platform">Desktop</span>
        <strong class="device-status">Pending</strong>
        <p>Runtime integration pending. The browser runtime was not connected to a desktop build in the last published status.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="device-report-card">
        <span class="device-platform">Mobile</span>
        <strong class="device-status">Unavailable</strong>
        <p>No mobile build was available in the last published status.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="device-target">
    <h2>Target architecture</h2>
    <strong>x86_64</strong>
    <p>auroraADE's documented target architecture. The wider Fabric Dessert CPU integration boundary is a separate platform-level capability.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/platform/">Platform architecture</a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
